    "short_description": "Can you lead? Burden of Command is an emotionally authentic tactical leadership RPG. You\u2019re a company Captain in the historical Cottonbalers. Fighting psychology as much as bullets, you must build respect, trust, and battlefield experience to bring your brothers safely home.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c...Aiming to be an Interactive Band of Brothers\u201d<br>Forbes<br><br>\u201cIt could prove to be one of the most memorable and affecting... games [about war] ever.\u201d<br>Rock, Paper, Shotgun<br><br>\u201cThe question that Burden of Command wants to answer is, what kind of leader are you, really? ... and in many cases the result is someone very different than the one we had imagined ourselves being.\u201d<br>Waypoint<br>",
